@When "^opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal$"
    When page trade portal searches and views trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And double click to navigate to trade detail and wait for page ready for stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail container is visible

@When "^approves the trade from the trade detail page$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And page trade detail clicks approve button
    And page trade detail confirms checker action and waits for page ready

@When "^rejects the trade from the trade detail page$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And page trade detail clicks reject button
    And page trade detail confirms checker action and waits for page ready

@Then "^the trade show correct info in trade details$"
    Then page trade detail basic info card is visible
    And page trade detail risk metrics section is visible
    And page trade detail instrument section is visible
    And page trade detail schedule section is visible
    And page trade detail history events card is visible
    And page trade detail audit trail card is visible

@Then "^the trade is pending checker approval in trade details$"
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'PARV'

@Then "^the trade remains Live in trade details$"
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'LIVE'

@Then "^the trade is reverted to Draft in trade details$"
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'DRFT'
